---
// Safe to edit by hand
// The optional site motif under the name on the /studio loading splash
// (src/pages/studio/index.astro, PORTS.md card 120). NOT PORTABLE: a site draws
// its own art here (plain SVG or HTML, decorative, no script).
//
// First Baptist Auburn: the phone-width brick path, the same file the Home
// banner draws along its foot (public/studio-banner/, card 118; npm run
// gen:stones writes it), two courses of auburn brick stepping up to the right.
// Its colours read on both the paper and the dark ground. The ends fade, since the
// art bleeds off its own edges on the Home banner.
---

<img
  src="/studio-banner/stone-path-phone.svg"
  alt=""
  width="390"
  height="96"
  decoding="async"
  style="mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 14%, #000 86%, transparent); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 14%, #000 86%, transparent)"
/>
